---
import PageLayout from "../../../components/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout lang="en" active="blog" title="Blog — Linxira OS">
    <h1>Blog</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Announcements, releases, and technical articles</p>

    <a href="/en/blog/direct-arch-transition/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-08-15</div>
      <div class="post-title">Linxira OS Today: From a Mint Prototype to Direct Arch</div>
      <div class="post-desc">Why Linxira moved from Linux Mint to Direct Arch — the desktop-supercomputer positioning, software ecosystem, and first-party toolchain.</div>
      <span class="post-tag">Announcement</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/en/blog/experimental-stable-2026-08-14/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-08-15</div>
      <div class="post-title">First Experimental Stable: 2026.08.14 Release Notes</div>
      <div class="post-desc">ISO download, release highlights, install-test results, and what changed since the betas.</div>
      <span class="post-tag">Announcement</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/en/blog/headless-mode/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-08-15</div>
      <div class="post-title">Headless Mode: One-Command Switching Between Desktop and Compute</div>
      <div class="post-desc">A standard systemd target switch that turns the desktop off and frees all RAM for compute.</div>
      <span class="post-tag tech">Technical</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/en/blog/signed-repository-supply-chain/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-08-15</div>
      <div class="post-title">Signed Repositories: Linxira's Supply-Chain Security Design</div>
      <div class="post-desc">How mandatory pacman signatures, release-key rotation, and a PKGBUILD CI gate block tampering.</div>
      <span class="post-tag tech">Technical</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/en/blog/catalog-v2-v3/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-08-15</div>
      <div class="post-title">One Reviewed Catalog Driving the Whole Software Ecosystem: catalog v2/v3</div>
      <div class="post-desc">The architecture behind one reviewed metadata source shared by the installer, Welcome, and graphical package management.</div>
      <span class="post-tag tech">Technical</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/en/blog/btrfs-snapshots-rollback/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-08-15</div>
      <div class="post-title">btrfs Snapshots and grub-btrfs: Self-Healing and One-Key Rollback</div>
      <div class="post-desc">Dual-kernel fallback, automatic pre-update snapshots, and direct rollback from the GRUB menu.</div>
      <span class="post-tag tech">Technical</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/en/blog/ai-cli-toolchain/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-08-15</div>
      <div class="post-title">AI Coding Agents in One Line: Mirror Acceleration and Six CLIs</div>
      <div class="post-desc">npm mirror acceleration plus one-line installs of Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Grok, and OpenCode.</div>
      <span class="post-tag tech">Technical</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/en/blog/newbie-guide-design/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-08-15</div>
      <div class="post-title">Designing the Beginner's Guide: Landing Linxira for Linux Newcomers</div>
      <div class="post-desc">How the new beginner's guide covers terminal basics, Arch Wiki navigation, Chinese input troubleshooting, and desktop choice.</div>
      <span class="post-tag tech">Technical</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/en/blog/introducing-linxira-os/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-06-27</div>
      <div class="post-title">Introducing Linxira OS</div>
      <div class="post-desc">What is Linxira OS, who is it for, and why we built it. Design philosophy, technical architecture, and target users.</div>
      <span class="post-tag">Announcement</span>
    </a>
<style>
    .subtitle { color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 3rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .post-card { display: block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.8), rgba(14,20,23,0.9)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2rem; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .post-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(32,184,176,0.4); }
    .post-date { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .post-title { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .post-desc { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .post-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.15); color: #20B8B0; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 0.75rem; }
    .post-tag.tech { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.15); color: #a78bfa; }
  </style>
</PageLayout>
